===Interjection===
{{en-intj|pos=[[hey]] [[presto]]}}

# {{UK}} Used by stage magicians, when waving a "[[magic wand]]" and performing a trick.
# {{UK|informal}} Indicates a sudden desirable conclusion or change, as if by [[magic]]; [[ta-da]]; [[voilà]].
#:''If you take the next left, you’ll see a big shop and '''hey presto''', you’re there.''